// SymbolicScreen (input)
"view.symbolicscreen.help"               = "Enigma calculates symbolic directions for the most recently selected horoscope. If multiple horoscopes are active, you can make a different choice.\n\nYou can choose from three time keys: One degree per year, The true solar arc, and The mean solar arc.\n\nTo calculate a symbolic direction, you must select an event. If needed, you can create a new event.\n\nClick the 'Calculate' button and you will see the symbolic directions in the middle part of the screen. To calculate symbolic directions for a different event, choose a different event and click 'Calculate' again.";
