// SymbolicResults (results screen)
"view.symbolicresults.help"                     = "The information shown in this screen depends on your configuration. This includes both the choice of factors in the radix and the factors you want to use for symbolic directions.\n\nYou see four tabs.\n\nThe 'Positions' tab shows an overview of the symbolic positions in longitude.\n\nThe 'Midpoints' tab shows an overview of both the directed planet relative to midpoints in the radix, and an overview of directed midpoints where a radix planet is located.\n\nThe 'Aspects' tab shows which symbolic directions form an aspect with a point in the radix. You also see the orb and the exactness of the aspect.\n\nThe 'Dual Wheel' tab shows the horoscope with the symbolic positions in an extra ring.";
"view.symbolicresults.title"                    = "Symbolic Direction Positions";
"view.symbolicresults.noresults"                = "Select an event and press Calculate to see positions.";
